# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599), Preacher #131 alone and selected on (44,22).
# CHEAT Create Unit row 13 "Foreign Unit" opens @FOREIGN ("Select Nationality To Create": English, French, Spanish, Dutch), then loops back to the @CREATE list;
# the next unit created gets that owner (DOS keeps it in [bp-0x16], port_bugs.md #666). Afterwards the list owns units to the human again.
# README warns that foreign units on another nation's tile "may cause significant problems" - nothing is moved or ended here.
# Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W), see map_cheat_create_unit.
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F1 shift             # @CREATE list
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down                 # row 13: Foreign Unit
key Return
shot
key Return               # @FOREIGN row 0: English
shot
key Return               # back in @CREATE: row 0 Colonists -> English Colonists
key F1 shift
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Return               # Foreign Unit again
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Return               # @FOREIGN row 3: Dutch
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Return               # row 6: Wagon Train -> Dutch Wagon Train
key F1 shift
key Return               # no Foreign pick this time: row 0 Colonists -> French again
shot
key w alt                # cheat mode off
